<title>FRANCE: EU adds 60,000 tns to Greek maize export quota.</title>
<headline>EU adds 60,000 tns to Greek maize export quota.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday added 60,000 tonnes to the quota of free-market Greek maize available for exports, member-country officials said.  </p>
<p>The European Union has already exported 86,000 tonnes of Greek maize under a previous 100,000 tonnes tender opened in November.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
